title: "CGIAR Agricultural Risk Intelligence Tool"
abstract: >
  An AI-powered platform for assessing the risk profile of agricultural small
  and medium enterprises. The tool automates the end-to-end risk-assessment
  workflow — document ingestion, gap detection over core enterprise fields,
  scoring across 7 categories and 35 indicators, and generation of a
  downloadable PDF report with narrative, evidence, and prioritised
  recommendations.
